@title Machine options: the documents follow the switch
@area Options
# The fixture is the example motor starter plus a Cooling fan page (only with the Cooling fan option)
# and a 480 V control transformer (only with Supply 480V). Chip in the status bar, switch from Ctrl+K,
# reports header, Project options window with the tie buttons and the cabinet heat.
open qa/fixtures/machine-options.novo
wait 20
expect "Options: no Cooling fan, Supply 400V"
shot chip-fan-off
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text option fan on
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Options: Cooling fan, Supply 400V"
shot chip-fan-on
click_text Reports #2
wait 20
expect "Machine: Cooling fan, Supply 400V"
expect "Left out of the documents: 1 device"
shot reports-fan-on
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text option fan off
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Machine: no Cooling fan, Supply 400V"
expect "Left out of the documents: 1 page, 3 devices"
shot reports-fan-off
check_layout
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
shot cabinet-keeps-everything
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text options
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Project options and variants"
expect "Tie the selection"
expect "Heat inside the cabinets"
shot options-window
check_layout
